msgid "The Bloch sphere plot shows the Z-axis rotation $|+\\rangle \\rightarrow P(\\frac{1}{2}\\pi)|+\\rangle$ where $\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k=\\frac{1}{2}\\pi$. The light green arrow shows the final state.\n"
msgstr "Ang Bloch sphere plot ay nagpapakita ng Z-axis rotation $|+\\rangle \\rightarrow P(\\frac{1}{2}\\pi)|+\\rangle$ kung saan ang $\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k=\\frac{1}{2}\\pi$. Ang light green na arrow ay nagpapakita ng huling estado.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
