msgid "Phase encoding is used in many quantum feature maps, particularly $Z$ and $ZZ$ feature maps, and general Pauli feature maps, among others.\n"
msgstr "Ang phase encoding ay ginagamit sa maraming quantum feature map, partikular na ang $Z$ at $ZZ$ feature map, at pangkalahatang Pauli feature map, bukod sa iba pa.\n"

